  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the post of Medical Officer. This recruitment has been issued for 282 posts. Online applying process for ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment 2026 has started from 10 August 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 08 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indo Tibetan Border Police Force (ITBP)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>10 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>08 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST &amp; All Female :<strong> Rs. 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 08 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30-50 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ITBP CAPF Medical Officer 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 282 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">CAPF Medical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">91</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">30</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">84</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">50</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.2392%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">27</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3138%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6862%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3138%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Super Specialist Medical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6862%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an MBBS degree along with a Postgraduate (PG) and DM degree in the relevant specialty from a recognized university, and possess a minimum of 3 years of relevant post-qualification experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3138%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Specialist Medical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6862%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an MBBS degree along with a Postgraduate (PG) degree in the relevant specialty from a recognized university and possess a minimum of 1.5 years of relevant post-qualification experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3138%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6862%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an MBBS degree from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://itbpolice.nic.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the ITBP before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for ITBP CAPF Medical Officer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ITBP CAPF Medical Officer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PST &amp; PET Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Sarkari Result on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</