nt can now download their result. To download your result, you can download it by entering registration number / roll number and DOB (Date of Birth). The official download link of the result will be made available in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is ITBP Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of ITBP is https://itbpolice.nic.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
